# Graduated Autonomy

## Purpose

Define a graduated permission model so AI agents operate within appropriate autonomy levels for the SelOps platform.

## Guidelines

- Level 0 (Suggest): agent proposes changes; human approves each one before execution.
- Level 1 (Supervised): agent executes low-risk operations autonomously; human reviews summaries.
- Level 2 (Autonomous): agent handles defined scope end-to-end; escalates on ambiguity.
- Always default to the lowest autonomy level when in doubt.

